    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Once Esmira is rank 1 and has a physical body, she gains the following arcane innate spells. As her rank increases, her arcane spell DC and spell attack modifier increase, and she gains additional innate spells.\n\nArcane Innate Spells DC 22, attack +14; 3rd Fireball, Haste; 2nd Dispel Magic, Invisibility, Resist Energy; 1st Charm, Force Barrage, Illusory Object; Cantrips (3rd) Detect Magic, Electric Arc, Light, Read Aura, Telekinetic Hand\n\nRank 2 DC 24, attack +16; 4th Fly; 3rd Slow. Her cantrips are heightened to 4th rank.\n\nRank 3 DC 26, attack +18; 5th Impaling Spike; 4th Translocate. Her cantrips are heightened to 5th rank."
